-- BID COLISEO DEMON - ENHANCED VERSION WITH CC FLOOR 150 MECHANICS
-- ==================================================================
--
-- EXISTING MOB GROUPS (already configured):
-- -----------------------------------------
-- 86012 - Main Boss (Mahoraga)
--         IMPORTANT: Set "nest type" = "fix" in spawn table to prevent despawning!
-- 86500 - Wave 1 enemies (8 enemies)
-- 86600 - Wave 2 enemies (8 enemies)
-- 86003 - Initial adds (spawn when boss engages)
-- 86006 - Regular adds (spawn at multiple HP thresholds)
-- 86011 - Eggs (spawn and despawn mechanic)
--
-- NEW MOB GROUPS YOU NEED TO CREATE:
-- -----------------------------------
-- 86013 - Mini-boss (spawns at 70% HP, makes main boss invincible until killed)
--         Suggestion: Use a strong elite mob, similar to boss but weaker
--
-- 86014 - Two mini-bosses (spawn at 50% HP, makes main boss invincible until both killed)
--         Suggestion: Create group with 2 strong elite mobs
--
-- 86020 - Bombs (AUTOMATICALLY SPAWNED IN WPS - NO NEED TO CREATE THIS GROUP!)
--         Bomb mob index: 18311128 (from CC/CCBD)
--         These are explosive mobs with low HP that deal AOE damage
--         Bombs spawn automatically at coordinates around the circular arena:
--         - 90% HP: 8 bombs in full circle
--         - 70% HP: 4 bombs at corners
--         - 50% HP: 6 bombs in hexagon pattern
--         - 30% HP: 4 bombs in square pattern
--         - 20% HP: 4 bombs in cross pattern
--         - 10% HP: 10 MASSIVE BOMBS everywhere!
--
-- 86021 - Support Mobs (AUTOMATICALLY SPAWNED IN WPS - NO NEED TO CREATE THIS GROUP!)
--         Mob IDs: 68131412 and 68131411
--         These spawn around the boss throughout the fight
--         - Initial: 4 mobs when boss engages
--         - 90% HP: 4 mobs
--         - 70% HP: 4 mobs
--         - 50% HP: 6 mobs
--         - 30% HP: 6 mobs
--         - 20% HP: 8 mobs
--         - 10% HP: 12+ MASSIVE WAVE!
--
-- MECHANICS SUMMARY:
-- ------------------
-- Initial: 4 support mobs (68131412, 68131411) spawn around boss when engaged
-- 90% HP: Eggs + 8 Bombs + 4 Support Mobs + Adds
-- 70% HP: Mini-boss + Boss becomes INVINCIBLE + 4 Bombs + 4 Support Mobs + Eggs (must kill mini-boss)
-- 50% HP: 2 Mini-bosses + Boss becomes INVINCIBLE + 6 Bombs + 6 Support Mobs + Eggs + Adds (must kill both)
-- 30% HP: 4 Bombs + 6 Support Mobs + Eggs + Adds
-- 20% HP: 4 Bombs + 8 Support Mobs + Eggs + Adds
-- 10% HP: 10 Bombs + 15 SUPPORT MOBS + Eggs + Adds (MASSIVE ENRAGE!)


